gorithms, these algorithms are typically progr...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"When programming stock investment recommendation algorithms, these algorithms are typically programmed to:","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"9","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"When programming stock investment recommendation algorithms, these algorithms are typically progr...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ignore smaller companies"},"2":{"Display":"Give more weight to random fluctuations in the market"},"3":{"Display":"Consistently keep track of investments"},"4":{"Display":"Prefer indices over specific stocks"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"1":"0","2":"0","3":"1","4":"0"},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"3","Grades":{"SC_3yiz1h5H6L2hvZY":"1"},"index":0}],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1112"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_eLEzpc3v07E3DzE","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1118","SecondaryAttribute":"AI can take images and short sound clips of people and create long, convincing impersonation of t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"AI can take images and short sound clips of people and create long, convincing impersonation of these people saying anything. What is this technology called?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"11","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"AI can take images and short sound clips of people and create long, convincing impersonation of t...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Deepmind"},"2":{"Display":"Deepfake"},"3":{"Display":"Deeple